<section class="sec scent" id="scent">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="kicker kicker--accent">Beyond body cream</span>
      <h2 class="h2">Find a scent that suits you, too.</h2>
      <p class="body">
        A fragrance you love can undo a routine that works. The same scan reads scent the
        way it reads cream: what is in it, what it is for, and whether your skin is likely
        to agree.
      </p>

      <ul class="chips">
        <li class="chip"><i></i> Fragrance allergens named</li>
        <li class="chip"><i></i> Reasons, not stars</li>
        <li class="chip"><i></i> Occasion-aware</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="scent__stage reveal">
      <img
        src="/images/fragrance-vial.webp"
        width="900"
        height="900"
        alt="A small unbranded glass fragrance vial on pale travertine, dried stems behind."
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
